  unitName: Sage God Melord
  unitId: 20857
  unitNumber: 1408
  description: Whilst Melord's body and mind rotted away as he transformed into the
    terrible Demon of Decay, his soul was the only part of him to retain its divinity.
    Were one to witness the crystallized form of Melord's soul, one would see a never
    fading splendor reminiscent of that of a high ranking god. Had his story been
    different, Melord would have likely distanced himself from his master, , to walk
    his own path towards further knowledge and wisdom, ultimately becoming a member
    of the Divine Ten himself.
  summonDesc: I am the mediator of this world,<br>and as such I shall welcome the
    end of humankind with my very eyes...
  fusionDesc: My will shall never falter.<br>I will gladly sacrifice myself to keep
    order in this world!
  evoDesc: Impudent human...<br>You could never hope to understand the power of my
    divine will.
  element: 2
  rarity: 7
